  "selection_rules": [
    "Look at every candidate before keeping it. Reject anything that looks like a cliche stock photo: handshakes, thumbs up, people smiling at the camera, white-background cutouts.",
    "Prefer photos where faces are not clearly identifiable (hands at work, backs, wide shots). A stock person on a business site can look like a staff member or an endorsement.",
    "Reject photos with visible brand logos, watermarks, text overlays, licence plates or shop signs.",
    "Reject heavy filters, HDR, fake lens flares and obvious AI-generated images.",
    "Prefer natural light, real locations and a calm composition.",
    "Within one niche, keep photos that look like they belong to the same business: similar colour temperature and style.",
    "Never keep the same photo for two niches or two slots.",
    "Record photo id, photographer name, photographer URL and photo page URL for every kept photo."
  ],
